error: perf3ct/fjo is archived and read-only (HTTP 423)

  request:    POST /api/v1/repos/perf3ct/fjo/issues
  repository: perf3ct/fjo

what to do:
  archived repositories are read-only.
  1. unarchive it at https://git.example.org/perf3ct/fjo/settings
  2. then run the command again
  reads still work: fjo issue list -R perf3ct/fjo
